INSERT INTO `questions` VALUES (1,1,'Updated Java Question','extends','implements','new','static','C',5,'2026-07-07 03:15:24',NULL,'MCQ',NULL),(2,1,'Which language runs inside a browser?','Java','Python','JavaScript','C++','C',2,'2026-07-07 03:53:13',NULL,'MCQ',NULL),(3,1,'Which keyword is used to create an object in Java?','this','new','class','object','B',5,'2026-07-07 06:48:24',NULL,'MCQ',NULL),(5,1,'Browser Test','A','B','C','D','A',2,'2026-07-11 10:44:39',NULL,'MCQ',NULL),(6,4,'which was the first techonology to come ','1231','3415','2345','62346','A',3,'2026-07-11 11:16:13',NULL,'MCQ',NULL),(8,9,'Binary Search requires?','Stack','Sorted Array','Queue','Heap','B',1,'2026-07-21 03:38:36','Binary Search works only on sorted arrays.','MCQ',NULL),(9,7,'wt is ur name\n','123324r','234','234','4234','A',1,'2026-07-21 06:16:46',NULL,'MCQ',NULL),(10,9,'binary serach tc?','nlogn','logn','n','1','A',5,'2026-07-21 13:09:08',NULL,'MCQ',NULL),(11,10,'tehconolody qn 2','1','2','3','4','B',5,'2026-07-21 13:10:03',NULL,'MCQ',NULL),(12,13,'What is the chemical symbol for sodium?','Na','Si','S','K','A',1,'2026-07-22 04:06:09','Na is the symbol derived from sodium\'s Latin name, natrium.','MCQ',NULL),(13,13,'Which of the following is NOT a primary component of human blood?','Red blood cells','Platelets','White blood cells','Muscle fibers','D',1,'2026-07-22 04:06:09','Muscle fibers are tissue cells, not part of the blood\'s cellular components.','MCQ',NULL),(14,14,'Which of the following is not a state of matter?','Solid','Liquid','Gas','Energy','D',1,'2026-07-22 04:08:07','Energy is a property, not a physical state of matter.','MCQ',NULL),(15,14,'What is the primary organ responsible for photosynthesis in plants?','Roots','Stems','Leaves','Flowers','C',1,'2026-07-22 04:08:07','Leaves contain chlorophyll and most photosynthetic activity occurs there.','MCQ',NULL),(16,16,'Who was the first emperor of unified China?','Qin Shi Huang','Sun Yat-sen','Mao Zedong','Genghis Khan','A',1,'2026-07-22 07:47:13','He founded the Qin dynasty in 221 BCE, becoming China’s first unified emperor.','MCQ',NULL),(17,16,'Which ancient civilization built the city of Machu Picchu?','Aztec','Inca','Maya','Olmec','B',1,'2026-07-22 07:47:13','Machu Picchu is a 15th‑century Inca citadel in the Andes.','MCQ',NULL),(18,16,'The Magna Carta was signed in the year:','1066','1215','1348','1400','B',1,'2026-07-22 07:47:13','King John sealed the Magna Carta in 1215, establishing early limits on royal authority.','MCQ',NULL),(19,16,'Who discovered the theory of evolution by natural selection?','Charles Darwin','Alfred Russel Wallace','Gregor Mendel','Louis Pasteur','A',1,'2026-07-22 07:47:13','Darwin’s On the Origin of Species (1859) introduced natural selection as the mechanism of evolution.','MCQ',NULL),(20,16,'The fall of the Berlin Wall occurred in:','1985','1987','1989','1991','C',1,'2026-07-22 07:47:13','The wall was opened on 9 November 1989, symbolizing the end of Cold War division.','MCQ',NULL),(21,17,'Which of the following is a correct example of a programming language used for web development?','HTML','JavaScript','Python','All of the above','D',1,'2026-07-22 07:52:54','HTML structures web content, JavaScript adds interactivity, and Python can be used for backend development.','MCQ',NULL),(22,17,'What is the primary function of a computer\'s CPU?','To store data permanently','To manage network connections','To process instructions and perform calculations','To display information on the screen','C',1,'2026-07-22 07:52:54','The CPU (Central Processing Unit) is responsible for executing instructions and performing operations.','MCQ',NULL),(23,17,'Which of the following is not a type of computer memory?','RAM','ROM','Cache','Printer','D',1,'2026-07-22 07:52:54','RAM, ROM, and Cache are all types of computer memory, while a printer is an output device.','MCQ',NULL),(24,17,'What does the term \'Wi-Fi\' refer to?','A type of computer hardware','A brand of computer software','A wireless networking technology','A type of computer virus','C',1,'2026-07-22 07:52:54','Wi-Fi is a technology that allows devices to connect to the internet wirelessly.','MCQ',NULL),(25,17,'Which of the following is a common example of a cloud storage service?','Google Drive','Microsoft Word','Adobe Photoshop','Spotify','A',1,'2026-07-22 07:52:54','Google Drive is a cloud storage service that allows users to store and access files online.','MCQ',NULL),(26,18,'In TCP congestion control, when a connection experiences multiple packet losses, which of the following statements correctly describes the sender\'s behavior?','The congestion window reduces to zero and remains there until ACKs for lost packets are received.','The slow start threshold is set to half the current congestion window and the sender enters congestion avoidance.','The sender immediately switches to using only retransmission timeout (RTO) based recovery for all subsequent packets.','The receiver sends a duplicate ACK for every out‑of‑order segment received, causing the sender to reduce its cwnd to zero.','B',1,'2026-07-23 04:31:00','On multiple losses TCP sets ssthresh to half cwnd and continues with linear growth (congestion avoidance).','MCQ',NULL),(27,18,'Which BGP attribute is primarily used to influence outbound traffic routing decisions made by neighboring autonomous systems?','Local Preference','Origin','AS Path','MED (Multi‑Exit Discriminator)','A',1,'2026-07-23 04:31:00','Local preference selects the best egress path within an AS, guiding outbound traffic toward neighboring ASes.','MCQ',NULL),(28,18,'Which statement about IPv6 Stateless Address Autoconfiguration (SLA) is false?','Nodes use router advertisements to obtain prefix and preferred lifetime.','The Duplicate Address Detection (DAD) mechanism ensures uniqueness of addresses on the link.','SLA automatically configures a 128‑bit address using only the router‑advertised prefix and the node\'s link‑layer address.','Nodes can obtain DNS server addresses via the Option in router advertisements.','C',1,'2026-07-23 04:31:00','SLA may use a random interface identifier (privacy) in addition to the prefix, not solely the link‑layer address.','MCQ',NULL),(29,18,'In an 802.1Q VLAN trunk supporting Q‑in‑Q (VLAN stacking), which field indicates the native VLAN for a frame after processing by the stacking switch?','TPID (Tag Protocol Identifier)','CFI (Canonical Format Indicator)','VLAN Identifier (VID)','EtherType','C',1,'2026-07-23 04:31:00','The VID field (set to 0 for the native VLAN) tells the switch to strip the outer tag and forward the frame natively.','MCQ',NULL),(30,18,'Which of the following statements about MPLS label forwarding is true?','The label stack is processed from top to bottom, with the bottommost label being the first to be replaced at each node.','The Experimental (EXP) field in the MPLS label is used exclusively for QoS marking and is not inherited from the IP header\'s DSCP.','When a packet traverses a LDP session, the label mapping message is sent from the receiver to the initiator to request a label.','The TTL field in the MPLS label is copied from the IP header\'s TTL and decremented at each hop, preventing infinite loops.','D',1,'2026-07-23 04:31:00','MPLS copies the IP TTL into its label TTL, decrementing it per hop to limit label‑stack loops.','MCQ',NULL),(31,19,'Which scheduling algorithm includes a mechanism to prevent starvation of low-priority processes?','First-In-First-Out (FIFO)','Round Robin','Priority Scheduling with Aging','Shortest Job First (SJF)','C',1,'2026-07-23 04:46:17','Aging increments the priority of waiting processes over time, ensuring that even low-priority jobs eventually get CPU time.','MCQ',NULL),(32,19,'Which memory management technique allows a process to use non-contiguous physical memory?','Contiguous allocation','Paging','Segmentation','All of the above','B',1,'2026-07-23 04:46:17','Paging divides memory into fixed-size pages that can be placed 