istive loss','Magnetic loss','Corona loss','B',1,'2026-07-24 10:08:07','It occurs due to wire resistance dissipating power.','MCQ',NULL),(78,29,'What is the primary function of the OS kernel?','User interface design','Managing system resources','Running web browsers','Creating text documents','B',1,'2026-07-24 10:11:00','The kernel acts as the core of the OS, managing CPU, memory, and hardware.','MCQ',NULL),(79,29,'Which mechanism prevents processes from accessing each other\'s memory?','Virtual Memory','Context Switching','Memory Protection','Spooling','C',1,'2026-07-24 10:11:00','Memory protection ensures that one process cannot interfere with the memory space of another.','MCQ',NULL),(80,30,'Which kernel type runs most OS services in kernel space?','Microkernel','Monolithic','Hybrid','Exokernel','B',1,'2026-07-24 10:25:40','A monolithic kernel handles most OS services in kernel space.','MCQ',NULL),(81,30,'What is the primary role of a bootstrap loader?','Manage memory','Initialize hardware and load the OS','Provide user interface','Handle networking','B',1,'2026-07-24 10:25:40','It configures hardware and loads the operating system during startup.','MCQ',NULL),(82,31,'Which scheduling algorithm can lead to starvation?','First-Come, First-Served','Shortest Job Next','Round Robin','Priority Scheduling','D',1,'2026-07-24 10:44:01','Priority scheduling may starve low‑priority processes if higher‑priority tasks keep arriving.','MCQ',NULL),(83,31,'What is the primary purpose of a Translation Lookaside Buffer (TLB)?','To cache disk blocks','To speed up virtual-to-physical address translation','To manage I/O buffers','To store page replacement algorithms','B',1,'2026-07-24 10:44:01','The TLB caches recent page table entries to reduce address translation latency.','MCQ',NULL),(84,32,'Which protocol is used to resolve IP addresses to MAC addresses?','DNS','ARP','DHCP','ICMP','B',1,'2026-07-24 10:55:04','ARP (Address Resolution Protocol) maps IP addresses to physical MAC ad